It follows Sokkan, a trusted confidante of two childhood friends Aadhi and Karuna,
whose loyalty is changed by a dynamic between betrayal and survival.

18
01:02:18,461 --> 01:02:24,461
The film was officially announced untitled in September 2023, and is Soori's
second film as the story's lead actor, after Viduthalai Part 1.

19
